Country flags
=============

The SVG files in this directory are the 4x3 set from the flag-icons project,
unmodified:

    https://github.com/lipis/flag-icons

taken from the repository as of 2026-04-07 (commit 086f7e9). File names are
flag-icons names: ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 in lower case (gb.svg, fr.svg), plus the
constituent countries of the UK as gb-eng.svg, gb-nir.svg, gb-sct.svg and
gb-wls.svg. users/includes/countries_inc.php maps each country to its file.

